# The necromancer's answer (docs/xardas-wrath.md): Xardas kills the hero with a spell, raises him as a
# skeleton where he fell, the screen goes black and the end card comes up. Without the server: the bridge's
# console command `ai necro <npc> [spell] [picture]`. Xardas is held as in a conversation (`ai attach`).
view clean 30
watch NONE_100_XARDAS
ai attach NONE_100_XARDAS
place 260 180
wait 800
cam two NONE_100_XARDAS 380 150 1
ui on
wait 500
rec necro
wait 800
ai necro NONE_100_XARDAS SPL_SKULL
wait 18000
stop
